{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53699","headline":"句 · 开成朝士","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"几人天上争仙桂，一岁闽南折四枝。\n（见乾隆十九年刊鲁曾煜等纂《福州府志》卷六十《文苑》）（〖1〗《福州府志》：「萧膺，字次元，侯官人，开成三年登第。\n是岁闽中同举者三人，朝士诗云〖诗略〗。\n自是闽号爲文儒之乡。\n官至大理司直。\n」注：「万历《府志》，参《闽书》。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"开成朝士","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53699.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53699","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}